      "writtenOn": "2024-11-07T19:19:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thinking about it more, I think it does work. We\u0027ve already replaced all `Override` values, that was done in the loop above. So anywhere they were used we want to now evaluate. The `Evaluator` already handles evaluating the operands, so either the operand is already `Constant` or the evaluator will calculate it for us.\n\nOr, put another way, I can\u0027t figure out how to write a test case that fails ... I added a test which requires multiple steps and multiple overrides, and then another which does exactly the same thing but flips the override usage and I can\u0027t make it fail ....",
      "parentUuid": "91f51333_219f8500",
